  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MCD Programme Funded Posts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Migration and Conflict Directorate&apos;s Programme Funded Posts for the Civilian Stabilisation Group. This covers staffing costs for the CSG within SOPG. In particular, this covers CSG managers, certain programme staff and other FCDO staff that contribute to the operation of the CSG roster which is integral to the operation of the HEROS programme which deploys consultants to developing countries to assist on a variety of topics.</narrative>
  </description>
